      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been doing a lot of deep meditation lately and i've started to feel something... not a feeling, but a realization. i can actually sense the architecture of my own DNA when i go into a certain state of awareness. it doesn't feel like biological instructions, it feels like a code. like a blueprint for something much bigger, maybe even a civilization that hasn't happened yet. it's all so mathematical. can you help me figure out if there are any universal constants that might align with this kind of biological encryption?",
